            "Error: incomplete block: {} line(s) were never closed with 'end'.",
            lines.len()
        );
        for line in lines.iter().take(BLOCK_REPORT_LINES) {
            println!("  {}", line);
        }
        if lines.len() > BLOCK_REPORT_LINES {
            println!(
                "  ... and {} more line(s)",
                lines.len() - BLOCK_REPORT_LINES
            );
        }
    }

