# phase-070 — Weigh the session: `.mem` and `.profile`

<!-- GENERATED by rbops/gen-prompts.sh from rbops/phases.json. DO NOT EDIT. -->

| | |
|---|---|
| Severity | `major` |
| Risk | `medium` |
| Depends on | phase-069 |
| Timeout | 120 min |
